TI  - The Role of Inhabited Institutionalism in Greening of the Industry initiatives
J2  - 
T2  - NEON conference 2024,Tromsø, Norway, 19.-21. november
AU  - Samuelsson, Sandra
Y1  - 2024///
PY  - 2024
DA  - 2024
